# 278-extend-arc-around-to-line: added by the parity loop from a Fusion probe
# extend-arc-around-to-line: Line y=0 (x -30..30) and a quarter arc r20 about the origin from (20,0) through (14.14,14.14) to (0,20); Extend the arc from its (0,20) end, which carries on round its circle to the line at (-20,0); extrude the half disc 10 mm.
{"cmd": "sketch.create", "plane": {"origin": [0.0, 0.0, 0.0], "normal": [0.0, 0.0, 1.0], "x": [1.0, 0.0, 0.0]}}
